      "writtenOn": "2025-03-01T00:18:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You\u0027re right.  I got confused because I thought you were trying to describe the world as it is, rather than to prescribe the future.  Now I recall that you changed the text in December to prescribe a stricter future, so what you\u0027re doing now is backing away from that prescription a little, because we probably can\u0027t get all TEEs to comply.\n\nThis makes sense to me.  We probably should work toward making all TEEs comply, though.  Unfortunately that\u0027s hard because `deleteAllKeys()` is hard to test.",
      "parentUuid": "b6582ef4_ae398ce5",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 558,
        "startChar": 7,
        "endLine": 560,
        "endChar": 75
